libdrm-sa (2.4.120-sa1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Qualcomm-only build based on upstream libdrm 2.4.120.
  * Renamed all packages from libdrm* to libdrm-qcom*.
  * Disabled non-Qualcomm vendor drivers: intel, nouveau, radeon, amdgpu,
    omap, exynos, tegra, etnaviv.
  * Enabled freedreno + freedreno-kgsl for Adreno GPU support.

 --  Chen Sun <chesun@qti.qualcomm.com> Wed, 09 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
